Competitive Landscape
Microsoft dominates the mobile BI arena with the Power BI mobile app, leveraging the Azure ecosystem and an extensive Office network. SAP extends its Analytics Cloud to mobile, delivering real time operational dashboards. IBM Cognos Analytics Mobile and Tableau Mobile are also significant players, particularly for their integration capabilities and visual analytics strengths.
Specialist vendors such as Qlik, MicroStrategy, Domo, Sisense, ThoughtSpot, and Looker complement the market by offering tailored deployment models, AI enhanced services, and industry specific templates that align with niche use cases.
